<report>
<title>General agreement over all (2) categories with <in>r</in> raters per subject</title>

<p><u>Cohen's kappa (Fleiss-Cuzick extension)</u><br />
Kappa = <inu>k</inu> (se = <inu>se</inu>)<br />
<in>pc</in>% CI: <inu>ll</inu> to <inu>ul</inu><br />
z (for k = 0) = <inu>z</inu><br />
<pval><inp>p</inp></pval></p>

<p><u>Universal (Berry-Mielke) R</u><br />
Weighted (linear) kappa = <inu>kw</inu><br />
<pval><inp>pw</inp></pval></p>
</report>
